ace\nDescription: The products integrated with our solution have been adapted by Coface:      New product:    Payment Index Assessment (a|late-payment-index)       Removed products:    URBA Trade payment (r|customized-report|305)    URBA Trade payment (m|customized-report | 306)       Changed default product names:   m|customized-report | 187: Monitoring ( 12 Months)  changed to Monitoring for Full Report plus IGF  m|customized-report | 303: Monitoring ( 12 Months) changed to Monitoring for Full Report URBA        Find the complete list of products here: Integrated Credit Agencies and Products  \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Finance\nLatest Revision: 2024-03-27\nValid as Of: 2024-03-27\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3224 ---\nComponent: Kyma Runtime\nEnvironment: Kyma\nTitle: Telemetry module: Deprecation of condition types\nDescription: With Telemetry version 1.11.0, we are deprecating condition types Running and Pending. They will be removed in future versions of the Telemetry module.  Please adjust your automation to rely on the new condition types instead (#805).\nAction: Required\nLifecycle: Deprecated\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-03-11\nValid as Of: 2024-03-26\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3225 ---\nComponent: Kyma Runtime\nEnvironment: Kyma\nTitle: Telemetry module: Update to version 1.11.0\nDescription: The new version brings the following improvements:  Logs and Traces:    For LogPipeline and TracePipeline, we are introducing new status condition types, following the Kubernetes conventions. (#805).    Metrics:      For the MetricPipeline input runtime, we are introducing the metrics *.cpu.usage, which replaces *.cpu.utilization.  This also fixes the calculation of the emitted metrics which are now calculated based on percentage instead of nanoseconds (#838).    \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-03-11\nValid as Of: 2024-03-26\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3226 ---\nComponent: SAP Alert Notification Service\nEnvironment: Other\nTitle: New SAP HANA Cloud Service Database Event\nDescription: You can now use the newly supported Data Lake HDB Compatibility event.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-03-26\nValid as Of: 2024-03-26\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3227 ---\nComponent: SAP Alert Notification Service\nEnvironment: Other\nTitle: SAP Build Code\nDescription: You can use the SAP Alert Notification service as part of SAP Build Code now.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-03-26\nValid as Of: 2024-03-26\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3228 ---\nComponent: SAP Alert Notification Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Update in HDB Out Of Memory event type\nDescription: The property host is now available under resouce.tags in HDB Out Of Memory event type\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-03-26\nValid as Of: 2024-03-26\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3229 ---\nComponent: SAP HANA Cloud\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Kyma,Other\nTitle: New component version available\nDescription: A new component version is available for the following SAP HANA Cloud components:   2024.02 (QRC 1/2024) for SAP HANA Cloud, SAP HANA database  2024.1.4051 (QRC 1/2024) for SAP HANA Cloud, data lake     \",689\n481,\"--- Record 2641 ---\nComponent: Forms Service by Adobe\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Availability - Additional Regions\nDescription: The SAP Forms service is now available in the following additional regions (Azure):    Europe - Netherleands (cf-eu20-001)  Switzerland - Zurich (cf-ch20 - EU access)    For more information, see also SAP Discovery Center.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-01-01\nValid as Of: 2024-07-09\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2642 ---\nComponent: Forms Service by Adobe\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: New Features\nDescription: The SAP Forms service provides the following new features:     A new landing page lets you access the Forms service tools and UIs easily.For more information, see Forms Service Landing Page.  You can now create a Forms service template store repository manually.For more information, see Create a Template Store Repository.  \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-01-01\nValid as Of: 2024-07-09\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2643 ---\nComponent: Kyma Runtime\nEnvironment: Kyma\nTitle: Keda module: Update to version 1.2.0\nDescription: In this release, we have updated the KEDA version to 2.14.0.  Additionally, we have introduced a dedicated priority class for the managed KEDA workloads, which prevents the eviction of the KEDA Pods in the resource-congested clusters.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-06-28\nValid as Of: 2024-07-09\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2644 ---\nComponent: SAP Task Center\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Minor Improvements\nDescription: For enhanced performance, the removal of unused API has been finalized.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-07-09\nValid as Of: 2024-07-09\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2645 ---\nComponent: SAP AI Core\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Generative AI hub\nDescription: Additional selected models from GCP Vertex AI are supported.  For more information, see SAP Note 3437766 .\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-07-08\nValid as Of: 2024-07-08\nVersion: Cloud